WEBVTT

00:05:26.829 --> 00:05:30.406
"If you interrupt a Zoom meeting,
you'll have to stay for the whole thing."

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.632
The first offender was
my 10-year-old daughter.

00:05:32.656 --> 00:05:36.015
She ended up sitting there for 45 minutes
with nothing to play with,

00:05:36.039 --> 00:05:38.387
and I can remember her
telling all the other kids,

00:05:38.411 --> 00:05:39.815
"Wow, don't go down there,

00:05:39.839 --> 00:05:43.203
because you're going to have to stay
for one of those boring meetings."

00:05:43.227 --> 00:05:44.901
Recorded caller 5: On one Zoom call

00:05:44.925 --> 00:05:47.082
where I was pleading
with government officials

00:05:47.106 --> 00:05:50.226
to please listen to the plight
of small business owners,

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:53.022
my five-year-old daughter walked behind me

00:05:53.046 --> 00:05:57.356
and said, "Mom, if you die of the virus,
I'll run your company,"

00:05:57.380 --> 00:05:59.553
and everyone went silent.

00:05:59.577 --> 00:06:02.266
Try to come back from that
when you're campaigning.